&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15 years’ experience leading enterprise sales or business development teams within healthcare, digital health, or benefits ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success engaging C-suite executives at Fortune 500 employer accounts and national consulting firms.&lt;/li&gt;
