&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Join our Revenue Operations team as the business partner to our growing Customer Success organization. You&#39;ll own the end-to-end B2B2C enrollment funnel—from eligibility through outreach to member enrollment—building the data, metrics, and operating cadence that drive measurable growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a senior, outcomes-focused role. Success means turning complex data into clear recommendations, moving work from analysis to action, and driving cross-functional alignment to deliver results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
