&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and resolve data gaps, system disconnects, and process inefficiencies limiting enrollment visibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop dashboards and insights that help CSMs and leaders improve funnel health, outreach performance, and conversion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
