&lt;li&gt;Work in an agentic coding workflow as a standard part of daily development — directing tools like Claude Code, Cursor, and GitHub Copilot to plan, implement, test, and review changes across the software development lifecycle. This is a core expectation of the role, not an optional add-on.&lt;/li&gt;
