&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing or upgrading forecasting tools, analytical workflows, or data models in a high‑growth, evolving, or public‑company environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in healthcare, digital health, health plans/PBMs, or other complex, regulated industries with multi‑stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
