&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, clinical, and cross-functional teams to turn vision into shipped product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own architecture and technical direction end to end for new member- and care team-facing experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply broad technical judgment across languages, frameworks, and systems, using modern engineering and AI-assisted tools to quickly build context, evaluate tradeoffs, and guide delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the quality bar: clean, well-tested, scalable code others build on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and multiply the team—mentor engineers, remove ambiguity, ship fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set 6–12 month technical direction and spot high-value work before it’s on the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
